@startuml C1_Complementary_Task_Categories_Scenario_View
title C1 – Complementary Task Categories (Scenario View)

left to right direction
skinparam usecase {
  BorderColor Black
  BackgroundColor HoneyDew
  ArrowColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
rectangle "Port Logistics Management System (PLMS)" as System {
  usecase "List Categories" as UC_List
  usecase "Search Categories" as UC_Search
  usecase "Create Category" as UC_Create
  usecase "Edit Category" as UC_Edit
  usecase "Delete Category" as UC_Delete
}

Operator --> UC_List
Operator --> UC_Search
Operator --> UC_Create
Operator --> UC_Edit
Operator --> UC_Delete

note right of UC_Create
  Category code must match expected
  format to keep consistency.
end note

@enduml
